# Render Auditor — Agent C (Cursor)

**Status: MANDATORY crew member** alongside Agent A (live layout) and Agent B (live images).

## Role

Agent C audits **answer blobs** (not live HTML) against locked gold templates and visual-lock law — specs: `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_TOP10.md` · `GOLDEN_TEMPLATE_QA.md`.

| Agent | What it audits | Engine |
|-------|----------------|--------|
| **A** | Live HTML — Direct Answer gold box, layout, CRO | DeepSeek + heuristic |
| **B** | Live HTML — image loads, pollinations, broken imgs | DeepSeek + heuristic |
| **C (Cursor)** | Blob markdown — gold template shape, visual lock, pollinations in body | **Rules only** (no DeepSeek) |

## Sample entries (every 3 min)

- `aq1160` — problem child
- `aq1158` — Top 10 gold ref
- `q11133` — Q&A gold ref

## Checks (Agent C)

- `pickGoldTemplate` classification
- `auditTop10GoldTemplate` or `auditQaGoldTemplate` / `auditGoldReferenceQa`
- No `image_before_direct_answer` · no `stacked_images`
- No live `pollinations.ai` URLs in blob
- `gradeEntry` score logged

## Gate

- `templateBlocked` — true when Agent C fails
- `speedupBlocked` — includes `templateBlocked` (batch writes pause)
- `deployBlocked` — still Agent A + B only (live render)

## Scripts

- `_render_audit_agent_c.js`
- `_render_audit_lib.js` → `cursorBlobGoldAudit()`
- Supervisor: `_render_audit_supervisor.js` (spawns A + B + C)

**START:** `Remove-Item _render_audit_stop.flag,_render_audit_agent_c_stop.flag -EA SilentlyContinue; Start-Process node -ArgumentList '_render_audit_supervisor.js' -WorkingDirectory C:\Users\koryj\website -WindowStyle Hidden`

**STOP:** `New-Item -ItemType File -Path _render_audit_stop.flag -Force`
